WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit and place a block lengthwise under the upper back.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lie back over the block and rest the arms open.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Let the head rest on the floor or a blanket.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe slowly into the chest.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
To exit, press up and remove the block.
